{"type":"message","id":"24cc9612","parentId":"f97f4568","timestamp":"2026-03-09T12:04:02.649Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_4fjq19CUO0EDbSZ8syawDtJC|fc_01be5dfe1ede7d790169aeb73359b08191bf3f24610d89e8ac","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Fetching latest skills\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"summarize\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Summarize\",\n      \"summary\": \"Summarize URLs or files with the summarize CLI (web, PDFs, images, audio, YouTube).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 11,\n        \"downloads\": 101051,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2211,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2174,\n        \"stars\": 433,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773033713031,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"github\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Github\",\n      \"summary\": \"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 82731,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1864,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1827,\n        \"stars\": 279,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gog\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gog\",\n      \"summary\": \"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 36,\n        \"downloads\": 93792,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1866,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1816,\n        \"stars\": 677,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772180053316,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"tavily-search\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Tavily Web Search\",\n      \"summary\": \"AI-optimized web search via Tavily API. Returns concise, relevant results for AI agents.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 28,\n        \"downloads\": 132307,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1776,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1740,\n        \"stars\": 680,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768114920544,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772978464005,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1768114920544,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release – AI-optimized web search skill using the Tavily API.\\n\\n- Provides concise, relevant web search results for AI agents.\\n- Supports advanced options: number of results, deep search, topics (general/news), and date range for news.\\n- Allows content extraction from arbitrary URLs.\\n- Requires TAVILY_API_KEY for usage.\\n- Designed for clean and efficient AI integrations.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"find-skills\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Find Skills\",\n      \"summary\": \"Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like \\\"how do I do X\\\", \\\"find a skill for X\\\", \\\"is there a skill that can...\\\", or express interest in extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the user is looking for functionality that might exist as an installable skill.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 4,\n        \"downloads\": 127224,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1586,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1556,\n        \"stars\": 564,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772893878086,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the find-skills skill.\\n- Helps users discover and install agent skills when looking for new functionality or extending agent capabilities.\\n- Provides clear guidance on searching for, presenting, and installing skills using Skills CLI commands.\\n- Includes examples and tips for effective skill discovery across common categories like web development, testing, and DevOps.\\n- Offers fallback options when no relevant skills are found, including help with tasks directly and guidance on creating new skills.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"weather\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Weather\",\n      \"summary\": \"Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 6,\n        \"downloads\": 70024,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1573,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1542,\n        \"stars\": 235,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545394459,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772616922629,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545394459,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \