lTime\": 991,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 970,\n        \"stars\": 176,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545365755,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545365755,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"nano-banana-pro\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Nano Banana Pro\",\n      \"summary\": \"Generate/edit images with Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Image). Use for image create/modify requests incl. edits. Supports text-to-image + image-to-image; 1K/2K/4K; use --input-image.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 39091,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 961,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 950,\n        \"stars\": 169,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545358090,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773025228516,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767651987917,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"skill-creator\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Skill Creator\",\n      \"summary\": \"Guide for creating effective skills. This skill should be used when users want to create a new skill (or update an existing skill) that extends Claude's capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, or tool integrations.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 29534,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 958,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 939,\n        \"stars\": 101,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769522677376,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773025746785,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769522677376,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of skill-creator, a comprehensive guide for designing modular skills to extend Claude’s capabilities.\\n\\n- Introduces principles for creating effective, concise, and domain-specific skills.\\n- Explains modular structure: required SKILL.md and optional scripts, references, and assets folders.\\n- Outlines guidelines for what to include (and exclude) in a skill package.\\n- Details progressive disclosure design for efficient context management.\\n- Provides reference patterns for organizing content and bundling resources.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"model-usage\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Model Usage\",\n      \"summary\": \"Use CodexBar CLI local cost usage to summarize per-model usage for Codex or Claude, including the current (most recent) model or a full model breakdown. Trigger when asked for model-level usage/cost data from codexbar, or when you need a scriptable per-model summary from codexbar cost JSON.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 21279,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 912,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 893,\n        \"stars\": 76,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767667639455,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065235893,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767667639455,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the model-usage skill for summarizing per-model usage and cost from CodexBar CLI local cost logs.\\n- Supports both Codex and Claude providers.\\n- Allows fetching summaries for the current (most recent) model or all models.\\n- Provides both text and JSON output formats.\\n- Can process costs directly from CodexBar CLI output or from a JSON file/stdin.\\n- Includes guidance for CLI use and script automation.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"darwin\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"himalaya\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Himalaya\",\n      \"summary\": \"CLI to manage emails via IMAP/SMTP. Use `himalaya` to list, read, write, reply, forward, search, and organize emails from the terminal. Supports multiple accounts and message composition with MML (MIME Meta Language).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 24420,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 841,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 826,\n        \"stars\": 48,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767954271328,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767954271328,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of Himalaya CLI email client skill.\\n\\n- Provides terminal-based email management via IMAP/SMTP.\\n- Supports listing, reading, composing, replying, forwarding, searching, and organizing emails.\\n- Includes multi-account support and message composition with MML.\\n- Detailed setup and configuration instructions included.\\n- Enables handling attachments, output customization, and debugging via logging.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gemini\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"summary\": \"Gemini CLI for one-shot Q&A, summaries, and generation.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 19293,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 820,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 808,\n        \"stars\": 39,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545316392,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772561786306,\n  