and managing water and sleep data\\n- Updated data format: renamed fields (e.g., \\\"timestamp\\\" → \\\"time\\\"), edited usage examples\\n- Removed metadata and some advanced examples (e.g., reminders, detailed stats)\\n- Focused on essential file operations: add, update, delete, and stats for water/sleep records\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"auto-updater\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Auto-Updater Skill\",\n      \"summary\": \"Automatically update Clawdbot and all installed skills once daily. Runs via cron, checks for updates, applies them, and messages the user with a summary of what changed.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 33055,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 483,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 459,\n        \"stars\": 221,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768323539453,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772074932947,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1768323539453,\n        \"changelog\": \"Automatically checks for and applies updates to Clawdbot and all installed skills once daily via cron.\\n\\nSends the user a message summarizing what was updated and any issues encountered.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"darwin\",\n          \"linux\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"humanizer\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Humanizer\",\n      \"summary\": \"Remove signs of AI-generated writing from text. Use when editing or reviewing\\ntext to make it sound more natural and human-written. Based on Wikipedia's\\ncomprehensive \\\"Signs of AI writing\\\" guide. Detects and fixes patterns including:\\ninflated symbolism, promotional language, superficial -ing analyses, vague\\nattributions, em dash overuse, rule of three, AI vocabulary words, negative\\nparallelisms, and excessive conjunctive phrases.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 39595,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 420,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 410,\n        \"stars\": 332,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769231736865,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769231736865,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release - Remove AI writing patterns based on Wikipedia's Signs of AI Writing guide. Detects 24 patterns including inflated symbolism, AI vocabulary, em dash overuse, and more.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"brave-search\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Brave Search\",\n      \"summary\": \"Web search and content extraction via Brave Search API. Use for searching documentation, facts, or any web content. Lightweight, no browser required.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 32490,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 385,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 365,\n        \"stars\": 133,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545304976,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767651953714,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"food-order\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Food Order\",\n      \"summary\": \"Reorder Foodora orders + track ETA/status with ordercli. Never confirm without explicit user approval. Triggers: order food, reorder, track ETA.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 2590,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 363,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 356,\n        \"stars\": 5,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545315134,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773025218491,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545315134,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"self-improving\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Self-Improving Agent (Proactive Self-Reflection)\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-reflection + Self-criticism + Self-learning + Self-organizing memory. Agent evaluates its own work, catches mistakes, and improves permanently. Use befo...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.2.10\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 32113,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 359,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 341,\n        \"stars\": 137,\n        \"versions\": 16\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1771266418607,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773057480753,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.2.10\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1772899624346,\n        \"changelog\": \"Sharper setup now lists relevant memory before non-trivial work, with a title that highlights proactive self-reflection.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"linux\",\n          \"darwin\",\n          \"win32\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"canvas\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Canvas\",\n      \"summary\": \"Display and control HTML content on connected Mac, iOS, or Android nodes via a web-based canvas with live reload and remote actions.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 1068,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 335,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 331,\n        \"stars\": 1,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1771261950369,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773029705503,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1771261950369,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of the Canvas skill for OpenClaw:\\n\\n- Adds ability to display HTML content on Mac, iOS, and Android node canvases\\n- Supports presenting, navigating, hiding, JavaScript eval, and screenshot actions for the canvas\\n- Integrates Tailscale and LAN binding options for easy remote access\\n- Includes live reload for instant updates during development\\n- Provides detailed setup, configuration, and troubleshooting instructions\\n- Serves files from a configurable root directory via a dedicated HTTP server\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"automation-workflows\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Automation Workflows\",\n      \"summary\": \"Design and implement automation workflows to save time and scale operations as a solopreneur. Use when identifying repetitive tasks to automate, building workflows across tools, setting up triggers and actions, or optimizing existing automations. Covers automation opportunity identification, workflow design, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), testing, and maintenance. Trigger on \\\"automate\\\", \\\"automation\\\", \\\"workflow automation\\\", \\\"save time\\\", \\\"reduce manual work\\\", \\\"automate my business\\\", \\\"no-code automation\\\".\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 28602,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 317,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 310,\n        \"stars\": 130,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770341582349,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770341582349,\n        \"changelog\": \"automation-workflows 0.1.0 initial release:\\n\\n- Launches comprehensive playbook for solopreneurs to design and implement no-code automation workflows.\\n- Covers identifying automation opportunities, workflow design principles, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), and best practices for testing.\\n- Includes maintenance and troubleshooting guidance to ensure reliability.\\n- Provides ready-made workflow templates and advanced automation ideas.\\n- Triggers include common phrases like \\\"automation,\\\" \\\"workflows,\\\" \\\"save time,\\\" and \\\"no-code automation.\\\"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"clawddocs\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Clawdbot Documentation Expert\",\n      \"summary\": \"Clawdbot documentation expert with decision tree navigation, search scripts, doc fetching, version tracking, and config snippets for all Clawdbot features\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.2.2\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 25438,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 320,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 309,\n        \"stars\": 239,\n        \"versions\": 5\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768099309187,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.2.2\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1768244234558,\n        \"changelog\": \"Added YAML frontmatter description for ClawdHub summary display\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"local-places\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Local Places\",\n      \"summary\": \"Search for places (restaurants, cafes, etc.) via Google Places API proxy on localhost.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 6376,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 296,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 290,\n        \"stars\": 19,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545354524,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772061341305,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545354524,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"frontend-design\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Frontend Design\",\n      \"summary\": \"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 25091,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 281,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 267,\n        \"stars\": 193,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767651960903,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772806748063,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767651960903,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"multi-search-engine\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Multi Search Engine\",\n      \"summary\": \"Multi search engine integration with 17 engines (8 CN + 9 Global). Supports advanced search operators, time filters, site search, privacy engines, and WolframAlpha knowledge queries. No API keys required.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"2.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 4,\n        \"downloads\": 26118,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 265,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 260,\n        \"stars\": 168,\n        \"versions\": 3\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770221093765,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772063741465,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"2.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770313848158,\n        \"changelog\": \"**Multi-search-engine v2.0.1 Changelog**\\n\\n- Updated documentation for conciseness, focusing on essential usage, supported engines, operators, and example queries.\\n- Removed the file `references/advanced-search.md` to streamline advanced search documentation.\\n- Revised and unified description to highlight 17 search engines, advanced operators, privacy-focused engines, and knowledge computation.\\n- Cleaned up and reorganized SKILL.md; made operator and time filter tables clearer for easier reference.\\n- Updated metadata in config and documentation files for accuracy and clarity.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"clawdhub\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Clawdhub\",\n      \"summary\": \"Use the ClawdHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawdhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawdhub CLI.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 15687,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 253,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 236,\n        \"stars\": 151,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545308330,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773025212640,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545308330,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"youtube-watcher\",\n      \"displayName\": \"YouTube Watcher\",\n      \"summary\": \"Fetch and read transcripts from YouTube videos. Use when you need to summarize a video, answer questions about its content, or extract information from it.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 6,\n        \"downloads\": 25548,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 233,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 228,\n        \"stars\": 190,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769327779866,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769327779866,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of youtube-watcher.\\n\\n- Fetch and read transcripts from YouTube videos.\\n- Summarize videos, answer questions, or extract specific information from transcripts.\\n- Trigger phrases include: \\\"watch youtube\\\", \\\"summarize video\\\", \\\"video transcript\\\", \\\"youtube summary\\\", and \\\"analyze video\\\".\\n- Requires installation of `yt-dlp` for transcript retrieval.\\n- Only works with videos that have closed captions or auto-generated subtitles.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"playwright-mcp\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Playwright MCP\",\n      \"summary\": \"Browser automation via Playwright MCP server. Navigate websites, click elements, fill forms, extract data, take screenshots, and perform full browser automation workflows.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 2,\n        \"downloads\": 17129,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 233,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 223,\n        \"stars\": 56,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770565004575,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770565004575,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"linux\",\n          \"darwin\",\n          \"win32\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"web-search\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Web Search\",\n      \"summary\": \"This skill should be used when users need to search the web for information, find current content, look up news articles, search for images, or find videos. It uses DuckDuckGo's search API to return results in clean, formatted output (text, markdown, or JSON). Use for research, fact-checking, finding recent information, or gathering web resources.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 15714,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 225,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 216,\n        \"stars\": 18,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769673454302,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773025879631,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769673454302,\n        \"changelog\": \"web-search 1.0.0\\n\\n- Initial release of the skill.\\n- Search the web using DuckDuckGo’s API for web pages, news, images, and videos.\\n- Supports multiple result formats: plain text, markdown, and JSON.\\n- Includes rich filtering (time range, region, safe search) and content-type options.\\n- Image and video searches offer flexible filters (size, color, type, duration, resolution, layout).\\n- Allows saving results to files for further use.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"pdf\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Pdf\",\n      \"summary\": \"Comprehensive PDF manipulation toolkit for extracting text and tables, creating new PDFs, merging/splitting documents, and handling forms. When Claude needs to fill in a PDF form or programmatically process, generate, or analyze PDF documents at scale.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 15250,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 200,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 200,\n        \"stars\": 22,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769847855729,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773026007528,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769847855729,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the PDF manipulation toolkit.\\n- Supports text and table extraction, PDF creation, merging, splitting, metadata extraction, and rotation.\\n- Guides for handling scanned PDFs (OCR), password protection, watermarking, and image extraction.\\n- Provides command-line tool usage (pdftotext, qpdf, pdftk, pdfimages).\\n- Recipes and code examples for Python libraries: pypdf, pdfplumber, and reportlab.\\n- Quick reference and next steps included for users needing advanced or form-related workflows.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"claw-shell\",\n      \"displayName\": \"claw-shell\",\n      \"summary\": \"Runs shell commands inside a dedicated tmux session named claw, captures, and returns the output, with safety checks for destructive commands.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 7944,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 196,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 190,\n        \"stars\": 4,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769948954608,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773026244690,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769948954608,\n        \"changelog\": \"claw-shell 1.0.0 initial release:\\n\\n- Provides an interface to run shell commands exclusively inside a tmux session named claw.\\n- Always creates or attaches to the session, ensuring isolation from other tmux sessions.\\n- Captures and returns command output to the agent.\\n- Includes safety checks: blocks potentially dangerous commands (e.g., sudo, rm, shutdown) unless user confirms.\\n- Simple, single-tool interface (`claw_shell_run`) with clear command input and safety guidance.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"baidu-search\",\n      \"displayName\": \"baidu web search\",\n      \"summary\": \"Search the web using Baidu AI Search Engine (BDSE). Use for live information, documentation, or research topics.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 18,\n        \"downloads\": 27716,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 191,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 188,\n        \"stars\": 62,\n        \"versions\": 8\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770291754419,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772777558277,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770955893565,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Added detailed usage instructions and request parameter documentation for the Baidu Search skill.\\n- Described available filters, including resource type, advanced search, website blocking, and date ranges.\\n- Provided example commands for common search tasks.\\n- Outlined current capability: fully functional for live Baidu web, image, and video search.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"qmd\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Qmd\",\n      \"summary\": \"Local search/indexing CLI (BM25 + vectors + rerank) with MCP mode.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 17789,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 188,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 183,\n        \"stars\": 61,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545374981,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545374981,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"xurl\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Xurl\",\n      \"summary\": \"Analyze Twitter content to uncover WordPress and Shopify client pain points, craft authority-building posts, and generate qualified inbound lead insights.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 2067,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 182,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 181,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1772451730315,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772451740029,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1772451730315,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of xurl skill: Twitter research and content intelligence for WordPress & Shopify.\\n- Analyze Twitter profiles, threads, and conversations to identify agency/eCommerce pain points and content opportunities.\\n- Extract high-performing content angles and propose authority-building posts.\\n- Turn Twitter insights into strategies for stronger positioning and qualified inbound leads.\\n- Designed for users who copy/paste Twitter content; does not require direct Twitter API access.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"stock-analysis\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Stock Analysis\",\n      \"summary\": \"Analyze stocks and cryptocurrencies using Yahoo Finance data. Supports portfolio management, watchlists with alerts, dividend analysis, 8-dimension stock scoring, viral trend detection (Hot Scanner), and rumor/early signal detection. Use for stock analysis, portfolio tracking, earnings reactions, crypto monitoring, trending stocks, or finding rumors before they hit mainstream.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"6.2.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 24526,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 188,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 178,\n        \"stars\": 130,\n        \"versions\