ites, navigate web pages, extract data from websites, take screenshots, fill forms, click buttons, or interact with web applications.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 17128,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 184,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 177,\n        \"stars\": 21,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770307091925,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773027079494,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770307243177,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial public release\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"browser-use\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Browser Use\",\n      \"summary\": \"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with w...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.2\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 21025,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 167,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 164,\n        \"stars\": 49,\n        \"versions\": 3\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769388231012,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773025618143,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.2\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1771476812023,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Documentation reworked and simplified for clarity and easier reference.\\n- Audience broadened: Skill now addresses general browser automation, not just sandboxed/cloud use.\\n- Install modes, tunnel setup, and environment variable explanations are removed for a more concise guide.\\n- New dedicated sections for browser modes, session management, essential commands, and Python execution.\\n- Updated and better-organized CLI command reference.\\n- Usage examples and options for real/Chromium/cloud browsers are clarified with practical guidance.\\n- For full advanced setup details, directs users to the official README.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"elite-longterm-memory\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Elite Longterm Memory\",\n      \"summary\": \"Ultimate AI agent memory system for Cursor, Claude, ChatGPT & Copilot. WAL protocol + vector search + git-notes + cloud backup. Never lose context again. Vibe-coding ready.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"ai\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"clawdbot\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"latest\": \"1.2.3\",\n        \"long-term\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"memory\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"openclaw\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"persistence\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 24123,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 170,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 160,\n        \"stars\": 103,\n        \"versions\": 4\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770050243398,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773026493789,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.2.3\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770799020241,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Expanded description and keywords for improved discoverability, highlighting ChatGPT, Copilot, Cursor, and developer tooling.\\n- Updated version to 1.2.3.\\n- Clarified compatibility and marketing text in SKILL.md.\\n- No functional or implementation changes to code logic.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"api-gateway\",\n      \"displayName\": \"API Gateway\",\n      \"summary\": \"Connect to 100+ APIs (Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, GitHub, Notion, Slack, Airtable, HubSpot, etc.) with managed OAuth. Use this skill when users want to...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.62\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 2,\n        \"downloads\": 36520,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 164,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 159,\n        \"stars