n with clean structured results, answer generation, and raw content extraction. Best for research tasks, news queries, fact-checking, and gathering authoritative sources.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"ai\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"search\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"web\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 14382,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 167,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 158,\n        \"stars\": 14,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769287990264,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773025535487,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769287990264,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release: AI-optimized web search with basic/advanced modes, domain filtering, news search, image search, and AI answer generation.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gmail\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gmail\",\n      \"summary\": \"Gmail API integration with managed OAuth. Read, send, and manage emails, threads, labels, and drafts. Use this skill when users want to interact with Gmail. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.6\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 21782,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 168,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 158,\n        \"stars\": 55,\n        \"versions\": 7\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770021074275,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.6\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770755759017,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Added clawdbot metadata for skill compatibility and requirements.\\n- Declared required environment variable (`MATON_API_KEY`) in the metadata section.\\n- No changes to functional documentation or API usage.\",\n        \"license\": null\n 