marizing news headlines, both as text and as short audio using OpenAI TTS.\\n- Included example output format for news summaries, grouped by topic.\\n- Outlined best practices: concise coverage (5–8 stories), balanced perspectives, and citation guidance.\\n- No functional changes to skill logic—documentation only.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"todoist\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Todoist\",\n      \"summary\": \"Manage tasks and projects in Todoist. Use when user asks about tasks, to-dos, reminders, or productivity.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.2.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 13189,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 126,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 124,\n        \"stars\": 39,\n        \"versions\": 3\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767852421167,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772161294256,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.2.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769577779661,\n        \"changelog\": \"Tweak ordering instructions\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"superdesign\",\n      \"displayName\": \"SuperDesign\",\n      \"summary\": \"Expert frontend design guidelines for creating beautiful, modern UIs. Use when building landing pages, dashboards, or any user interface.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 16271,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 123,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 122,\n        \"stars\": 94,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767719074735,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767719074735,\n        \"changelog\": \"Frontend design guidelines based on SuperDesign patterns\",\n        \